%% Local knowledge retrieval used by planning
flowchart TB
  Profile[Candidate Profile] --> Flatten[Collect Role Skills and Evidence Text]
  Flatten --> Tokens[Normalize Tokens and Remove Stop Words]
  Tokens --> Domain[Score Knowledge Domains]
  Tokens --> Topic[Score Topic Tokens]
  Topic --> Bonus[Apply Exact Title Bonus]
  Domain --> Rank[Deterministic Ranking]
  Bonus --> Rank
  Rank --> Top[Select Up to Eight Topics]
  Top --> Context[Planner Knowledge Context]
